@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title OpenData 4.0.0 — First-Run Initialisation Sequence
autonumber
actor Operator
participant "OpenData bootstrap" as Bootstrap
participant "JavaFX InitialisationWizard" as Wizard
participant "InitialisationService" as Service
participant "SqlServerInitialiser" as Initialiser
participant "Plugin definition discovery" as Discovery
database "SQL Server" as Database
collections "config/application.properties" as Properties

Bootstrap -> Properties: Read init flag and bootstrap settings
alt init=true
  Bootstrap -> Wizard: Display three-step wizard
  Operator -> Wizard: SQL Server, app login, AES key settings
  Wizard -> Wizard: Validate entries and review
  Operator -> Wizard: Confirm Initialise
  Wizard -> Service: initialise(request, progressCallback)
  note over Wizard,Service: Runs on JavaFX background Task
  Service -> Initialiser: Provision database and application account
  Initialiser -> Database: Create core schema / tables / role
  Database --> Initialiser: DDL results
  Initialiser --> Service: Provisioned database
  Service -> Discovery: Load packaged and external plugin definitions
  Discovery --> Service: Validated plugin definitions
  Service -> Database: Install schemas and register disabled plugins
  Database --> Service: Registration results
  Service -> Properties: Persist encrypted credentials, AES key path, init=false
  Properties --> Service: Saved configuration
  Service --> Wizard: Success and progress log
  Wizard --> Operator: Finish — Open OpenData
  Wizard -> Bootstrap: Open main JavaFX interface
else init=false
  Bootstrap --> Operator: Run normally (GUI or CLI)
end
opt Setup failure
  Service --> Wizard: Error / diagnostic progress
  Wizard --> Operator: Setup failed; correct and retry
  note over Service,Properties: init remains true; avoid storing admin password
end
@enduml
